  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:14.000" end="00:16.000" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, just touched down</p>
      <p begin="00:16.000" end="00:18.000" ttm:agent="v1">Hoppin' right off my jet</p>
      <p begin="00:18.000" end="00:20.000" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, lookin' around</p>
      <p begin="00:20.000" end="00:21.500" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't seen a bitch I met</p>
      <p begin="00:21.000" end="00:23.000" ttm:agent="v1">Thinkin' 'bout you and the things I said</p>
      <p begin="00:23.000" end="00:24.500" ttm:agent="v1">I can't lose, I ain't been there yet</p>
      <p begin="00:24.000" end="00:26.000" ttm:agent="v1">Got a new girl everywhere I go</p>
      <p begin="00:26.000" end="00:28.000" ttm:agent="v1">Trust me, bro, I don't want your ho</p>
      <p begin="00:28.000" end="00:29.750" ttm:agent="v1">Out here complaining</p>
      <p begin="00:29.750" end="00:31.500" ttm:agent="v1">I can't give you all of me</p>
      <p begin="00:31.500" end="00:33.000" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, what you sayin'?</p>
      <p begin="00:33.000" end="00:35.000" ttm:agent="v1">I don't want the honesty</p>
      <p begin="00:35.000" end="00:36.900" ttm:agent="v1">Please stop the playin'</p>
      <p begin="00:36.900" end="00:39.900" ttm:agent="v1">This isn't for all to see</p>
      <p begin="00:39.900" end="00:41.400" ttm:agent="v1">Promise you're makin' it out</p>
      <p begin="00:40.000" end="00:42.000" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna be</p>
      <p begin="00:42.000" end="00:43.500" ttm:agent="v1">Five bands</p>
      <p begin="00:43.000" end="00:44.900" ttm:agent="v1">Puttin' my racks on the night stand</p>
      <p begin="00:44.900" end="00:46.400" ttm:agent="v1">Cookin' up shit for the right hand</p>
      <p begin="00:46.000" end="00:48.000" ttm:agent="v1">Too damn lit, need a hype man</p>
      <p begin="00:48.000" end="00:50.000" ttm:agent="v1">She not really my type, man</p>
      <p begin="00:50.000" end="00:52.000" ttm:agent="v1">Stay, stay around, gotta watch my back</p>
      <p begin="00:52.000" end="00:53.500" ttm:agent="v1">Too fucked up</p>
      <p begin="00:53.000" end="00:54.500" ttm:agent="v1">Don't know where I'm at</p>
      <p begin="00:54.000" end="00:55.500" ttm:agent="v1">Been a long time</p>
      <p begin="00:54.750" end="00:56.250" ttm:agent="v1">But she don't know that</p>
      <p begin="00:55.750" end="00:58.000" ttm:agent="v1">Can't you get enough of me?</p>
      <p begin="00:58.000" end="00:59.900" ttm:agent="v1">I can't get enough of you</p>
      <p begin="00:59.900" end="01:01.500" ttm:agent="v1">You gon' give me third degree</p>
      <p begin="01:01.500" end="01:03.250" ttm:agent="v1">No idea of what to do</p>
      <p begin="01:03.250" end="01:06.500" ttm:agent="v1">You keep me out of mind</p>
      <p begin="01:06.500" end="01:08.000" ttm:agent="v1">Out of jail</p>
      <p begin="01:07.250" end="01:10.750" ttm:agent="v1">There's nothin' I don't think you tell</p>
      <p begin="01:10.750" end="01:12.250" ttm:agent="v1">I been out here for a minute</p>
      <p begin="01:12.000" end="01:14.000" ttm:agent="v1">My bitch bad and my windows tinted</p>
      <p begin="01:14.000" end="01:16.000" ttm:agent="v1">I'm 'boutta reach my venue</p>
      <p begin="01:16.000" end="01:17.500" ttm:agent="v1">Please speak up, mate, you way too timid</p>
      <p begin="01:17.000" end="01:18.750" ttm:agent="v1">Right foot jump, then step</p>
      <p begin="01:18.750" end="01:21.000" ttm:agent="v1">Body work's done by the time I left</p>
      <p begin="01:21.000" end="01:22.500" ttm:agent="v1">Talkin' my shit</p>
      <p begin="01:22.000" end="01:23.500" ttm:agent="v1">Get it off my chest</p>
      <p begin="01:23.000" end="01:24.500" ttm:agent="v1">Give me one more</p>
      <p begin="01:23.750" end="01:25.250" ttm:agent="v1">This ain't even my best</p>
      <p begin="01:24.850" end="01:26.350" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, just touched down</p>
      <p begin="01:26.000" end="01:28.000" ttm:agent="v1">Hoppin' right off my jet</p>
      <p begin="01:28.000" end="01:30.000" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, lookin' around</p>
      <p begin="01:30.000" end="01:31.750" ttm:agent="v1">I ain't seen a bitch I met</p>
      <p begin="01:31.750" end="01:33.250" ttm:agent="v1">Thinkin' 'bout you and the things I said</p>
      <p begin="01:33.250" end="01:35.000" ttm:agent="v1">I can't lose, I ain't been there yet</p>
      <p begin="01:35.000" end="01:37.000" ttm:agent="v1">Got a new girl everywhere I go</p>
      <p begin="01:37.000" end="01:38.850" ttm:agent="v1">Trust me, bro, I don't want your ho</p>
      <p begin="01:38.850" end="01:40.350" ttm:agent="v1">Out here complaining</p>
      <p begin="01:40.000" end="01:42.000" ttm:agent="v1">I can't give you all of me</p>
      <p begin="01:42.000" end="01:43.750" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, what you sayin'?</p>
      <p begin="01:43.750" end="01:45.750" ttm:agent="v1">I don't want the honesty</p>
      <p begin="01:45.750" end="01:47.500" ttm:agent="v1">Please stop the playin'</p>
      <p begin="01:47.500" end="01:49.750" ttm:agent="v1">This isn't for all to see</p>
      <p begin="01:49.750" end="01:51.650" ttm:agent="v1">Promise you're makin' it out</p>
      <p begin="01:51.650" end="01:53.150" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna be</p>
      <p begin="01:53.000" end="01:54.500" ttm:agent="v1">Five bands</p>
      <p begin="01:53.900" end="01:56.000" ttm:agent="v1">Puttin' my racks on the night stand</p>
      <p begin="01:56.000" end="01:57.500" ttm:agent="v1">Cookin' up shit for the right hand</p>
      <p begin="01:57.000" end="01:59.000" ttm:agent="v1">Too damn lit, need a hype man</p>
      <p begin="01:59.000" end="02:00.500" ttm:agent="v1">She not really my type, man</p>
      <p begin="02:00.500" end="02:02.900" ttm:agent="v1">Stay, stay around, gotta watch my back</p>
      <p begin="02:02.900" end="02:04.400" ttm:agent="v1">Too fucked up</p>
      <p begin="02:03.750" end="02:05.250" ttm:agent="v1">Don't know where I'm at</p>
      <p begin="02:04.900" end="02:06.400" ttm:agent="v1">Been a long time</p>
      <p begin="02:05.800" end="02:08.670" ttm:agent="v1">But she don't know that</p>
      <p begin="02:08.670" end="02:12.670" ttm:agent="v1"/>
